<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<chapter xml:id="ch-chunk-hooks" xmlns:xi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XInclude">
  <title>Chunk Hooks</title>

  <p>
    This chapter is a skeleton to be filled in. It will introduce chunk hooks,
    which are functions triggered by chunk options to execute additional tasks
    beyond running the code in a chunk, such as post-processing plots or
    recording execution time.
  </p>

</chapter>
